# Backend

Express + PostgreSQL API for WINBD-PRO.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
npm install
npm run migrate
npm run create-admin -- admin "A-strong-password-at-least-12-chars" admin@example.com
npm start
```

API and static apps are served from the same origin by default.

